  "fishing_pool": "wild-edge",
  "description": "Wild Edge is a forest pool enclosed by rocks, conifers and autumn-coloured trees. A waterfall drops from the upper rock face into deep blue-green water, and another narrow cascade leaves the pool near the bottom of the scene. A timber landing and a small boat sit on the left bank; a footbridge crosses the outflow below. A round campfire clearing lies higher on the left, while a dark rock opening and a rising dirt path mark the upper-right bank. Painted deer stand among the trees beside the pool. The banks, falls and bridge form a compact wilderness scene with water at its centre.",
